# Build context is the repo root (see the Dockerfile), so the per-app
# .dockerignore never applies; BuildKit reads this Dockerfile-specific file
# instead. Patterns are relative to the repo root.
#
# Locally staged Spectrum Next assets (NextZXOS ROMs, SD-card images) must
# never be sent to the daemon or shipped in an image.
**/public/next/
apps/gif-service/next-assets/
*.mmc
*.mmc.zip
